{"candidateAnswer":"An online presence focused on his automotive work","evidence":"[D28:8 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work! By the way, I recently started a blog on car mods. It's my way to share my passion with others. Do you have any tips on blogging for me? Just take a look at this beautiful car!\n\n","itemId":"urn:uuid:6f59cdc0-9dc3-5688-93a0-0a861a522dc8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d76b12a88327cb0a75957347afa97d5dfb8489664b3f9bd9df7aa3d41f1f0bb8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Dave recently start a blog about?","referenceAnswer":"Car mods","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d76b12a88327cb0a75957347afa97d5dfb8489664b3f9bd9df7aa3d41f1f0bb8"}}]}